{
  "_id": "c1qjY2L4hq8JWfscRb_dD",
  "_type": "Doc",
  "_index": "ZoV",
  "title": "Alinea Cloud",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Alinea Cloud",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1lPXbCQrPyBIevSSZp91utX",
              "_link": "url",
              "href": "https://www.alinea.cloud"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " is a hosted backend for your handler. It signs editors in, lets you invite users and give them roles, stores uploads and commits changes to your git repository. You don't need a database or auth provider of your own."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Connect your site"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "connect-your-site"
    },
    {
      "_type": "orderedList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Prepare and deploy your site",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "2YlEhUcMm8GgmJorhjRWUVpZ6TI",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "28NgMpMQkmTy4uyFhPj8z4XVqml"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " with a handler that has no `backend` option: `createHandler({cms})`."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Open the dashboard on your deployed site (`/admin`, or your `adminPath`). It shows "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Ready to deploy?",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " because no backend is configured yet."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Choose "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Continue with alinea.cloud",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " and follow the setup on Alinea Cloud. It gives you an API key for your site."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Add the key to your hosting environment as `ALINEA_API_KEY` and redeploy."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Alinea Cloud then verifies the connection with a handshake request to your handler. From there on editors sign in on `/admin` with their Alinea Cloud account."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "3JkF1rvAX5Jxz0eXBCIZ6qxrnTD",
      "code": "ALINEA_API_KEY=alineapk_...",
      "fileName": "",
      "language": "shellscript"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Users and roles"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "users-and-roles"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Invite editors from Alinea Cloud. During the handshake your handler reports the "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "roles",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF1rnWkSTtL6J9k7VfgF5kyAS",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "3AhqfX37Pijf2zOEwYVVU4NmdHG"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " defined in your config, with their labels and descriptions, so you can assign them to users there. The "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Manage users",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "bold"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " screen of the self-hosted dashboard isn't used with Alinea Cloud."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Good to know"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "good-to-know"
    },
    {
      "_type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`ALINEA_API_KEY` identifies your site, keep it secret. Without it the dashboard keeps showing the setup screen."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Your content stays in your repository. Alinea Cloud commits to it for you, so you can move to a "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "self-hosted backend",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JkF1n3r9PPPC47T37uQeVlocMn",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "2YlEGKqhO4mqRqEwQexeqRI8Jfu"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " later without migrating content."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "Local development doesn't use Alinea Cloud: `alinea dev` saves to your local files."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
